      "message": "i wanted to ask about one thing. maybe this is not an issue because\nit doesn\u0027t look like we share interrupts among TCPCs here:\n\nwe had issues on brya where servicing a TCPC interrupt shared by 2 TCPCs\nwould wake up the non-alerting TCPC i.e. generate an alert/interrupt\ndue to the wake-up.\nthis was often a self-sustaining interrupt storm.\n\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/2700314\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/2977473\n\nis that an issue here as well?",
      "revId": "fb0bef37409961e26e69ffd95de1be454b2540c5",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
