      "writtenOn": "2025-08-18T21:59:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, the issue you shared is specific to nct38xx. Nissa uses RAA489000. I haven\u0027t seen any reports of this issue occurring on Nissa.\n\nOn nissa, the root cause of the interrupt storm is the TCPC_REG_POWER_CTRL_VOLT_ALARM_DIS register getting cleared on the TCPC the resulting alarm never clearing. This change ignores this specific alarm since it isn\u0027t part of the alert mask.",
      "parentUuid": "8cf7895f_5e6e481a",
      "revId": "fb0bef37409961e26e69ffd95de1be454b2540c5",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
